# title: Basket call
# category: Multi-asset
# underlyings: 3
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call on the equally weighted average performance of three stocks: diversification makes it cheaper than three calls.
# param: notional = 1000 | amount | Notional
# param: strike = 1.0 | percent | Strike on the basket performance
#
# Performance of each stock = final / strike-date level.

2027-01-04
    notional = 1000
    strike = 1.0
    s0 = spot(0)
    s1 = spot(1)
    s2 = spot(2)

2028-01-04
    basket = (spot(0) / s0 + spot(1) / s1 + spot(2) / s2) / 3
    pays notional * max(basket - strike, 0)
